    "title": "Ottumwa's Jefferson Street Bridge reopens to traffic with temporary fix - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By NEWS DESK ,\n12 hours ago OTTUMWA, Iowa - The Jefferson Street Bridge in Ottumwa reopened to traffic on Wednesday. The bridge was closed on March 13 after a damaged expansion joint was discovered. A steel plate is being used to span the damaged joint until permanent repairs can be made. Due to engineer recommendations regarding... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
